      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should be `charge_manager_set_acokref(5000)`.  Setting ACOKREF to 0 is an ISL9xxx specific behavior.\n\nI think it would be better if the charge manager managed ACOKREF directly, rather than having the PDC subsystem do it.\n\nThe charge manager should do this anytime it selects a new charge port/charge voltage.",
