      "writtenOn": "2026-01-26T17:21:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good catch.\n\nI was looking into how charge_manager can handle setting ACOKREF directly in `charge_manager_refresh`, but it lacks knowledge on when sink paths are disabled on all ports. `charge_manager` basically tells PDC system to enable sink path on port N and it handles disabling and enabling sequence for each port. \n\nIt would be nice to reduce this tech debt in charge manager.",
